  "description": "Lucia, the powerful 1st gen. warrior, studied hard in school and worked her way up the ladder in the corporate world. Yet she still finds herself unable to get the respect she deserves from those around her and society itself. Disappointed and frustrated by the ugly side of life, she decides to destroy the world. Now, the world's destiny depends on the newer generation warriors to stop her. \n\n(Source: NetComics)",
